  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida Stipendium till ICSB Annual Conf 2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida Stipends to ICSB Annual Conf 2010</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Collaboration with the Capacity Development and Cooperation Unit concerning stipends for allegiable researchers and entrepreneurs from developing countries to participate in the Annual Conference of the ICSB (International Council for Small Business) to be held in Stockholm on June 15-18 2011. Lobal partners are the Swedish Agency for Economic and Regional Growth and Swedish Entrepreneurship Forum.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbete med Enheten f&#xf6;r kapacitetsutveckling och samverkan om stipendiepengar f&#xf6;r forskare och entrepren&#xf6;rer fr&#xe5;n utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder f&#xf6;r deltagande i ICSB (International Council for Small Business) &#xe5;rliga konferens som h&#xe5;lls i Stockholm den 15-18 juni 2011.  Medarrang&#xf6;rer &#xe4;r Tillv&#xe4;xtverket och Swedish Entrepren&#xf6;rship Forum.</narrative>
  </description>
